ps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 12, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "enpe7n2le02ob12re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "<strong>Narrator:</strong> Please, welcome Mr. Kevin M.</br></br>", "image": "enpe7n2le02ob12re2img01.jpg", "id": 0}, {"time": "3000", "text": "<strong>Kevin M:</strong> One of the most important parts of the Central Processing Unit is the Arithmetic Logic Unit, let's call it ALU.\nALU is a complex digital circuit that performs basic mathematical operations and calculations, such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. And some other complex operations that require more space in CPU. When ALU is working it disperses heat and energy, now you know why computers get hot when working. </br></br>John Von Neumann proposed the ALU concept in 1945. Some of the most important functions of ALU are first, bitwise, that's the operation of individual bits of binary rules. Secondly, mathematical operations with binary numbers, that's the base 2 number system and the primary language for computers.\nALU functions are necessary processes in order to work correctly. The CPU processes most of the data, so ALU is an important and vital part of data processing.</br></br>", "image": "enpe7n2le02ob12re2img02.jpg", "id": 1}, {"time": "73000", "text": "ALU can also perform logic operations with values NOT, AND, OR.</br>\nALU data processing speed can be fast or slow, depending on the processor, its quality and price. You have this cheap and old processor that is very slow but you can retrieve your data processing speed if you have a good quality processor that transfers the data fast enough in order to make fast and successful transfers. That sounds expensive but if you want quality, that's what you have to do, buy an expensive but effective processor.</br></br>ALU is an important part of the computer system, without it, operations would become hard to solve.</br>\nGood maintenance is a key element if you want to keep your CPU clean, fast, and powerful. Your computer is not an object, it's also your friend ...! Don't forget that!\nThank you very much!", "image": "enpe7n2le02ob12re2img03.jpg", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n2le02ob12re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "title": "", "id": 1, "type": "audio"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "image": "", "id": 0}], "video_src": "enpe7n2le02ob12re5vsc01"}, "type": "video"}], "title": "", "id": 4, "type": "video"}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}